msgstr "Переопределение параметров"

#: plugins/ollamacommon/ollamacommonoverrideparameterswidget.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"The temperature of the model. Increasing the temperature will make the model "
